WEBVTT

00:05:29.704 --> 00:05:30.788
No ...

00:05:30.788 --> 00:05:32.913
I wore Spanx like a grown-up.

00:05:32.913 --> 00:05:35.246
(Laughter and applause)

00:05:35.246 --> 00:05:36.246
That's right.

00:05:36.246 --> 00:05:38.663
(Applause and cheers)

00:05:39.163 --> 00:05:41.954
If you’ve ever worn Spanx,
then, you know ...

00:05:41.954 --> 00:05:44.204
the saddest part about wearing them

00:05:44.204 --> 00:05:46.204
is taking them off
at the end of the night.

00:05:46.663 --> 00:05:48.454
You put them on, you feel invicible,

00:05:48.454 --> 00:05:51.329
but then the night comes
and it’s like “Womp, womp womp.”

00:05:51.371 --> 00:05:53.246
They just roll off.

00:05:53.496 --> 00:05:55.996
All you have to show for your hard work

00:05:55.996 --> 00:05:58.329
is a roadmap of pain embedded --

00:05:58.329 --> 00:05:59.371
(Laughter)

00:05:59.371 --> 00:06:02.079
into your skin ...